  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "The meal is over, and the children help tidy up. There are some leftovers, a paper wrapper, and a dirty used napkin on the tray. With an adult nearby, one child pours the remaining drink into a special hole. An empty cup stands on the tray. There is nothing inside the cup; it is empty. The other child helps sort the used items by checking the pictures above the bins. The trash can is beside the recycling bin. The children stand on the floor beside the bins. The adult returns a tray to the rack at the tray return station. Nearby, an employee wipes a table with a wet cleaning cloth. The far end of the table is already clean. A broom, a dustpan, and a mop are beside the cleaning cart. A trash bag rests beside the cart, away from the messy table. Near the exit sign, other customers leave the restaurant. Soon, the children will be ready to leave, too.",
    "textZh": "用餐結束了，小朋友幫忙整理。托盤上有一些剩餘食物、食物包裝紙和一張用過而且弄髒的餐巾紙。大人在旁邊陪同，一位小朋友將剩餘飲料倒進專用收集孔。一個空杯子放在托盤上。杯子裡沒有東西；它是空的。另一位小朋友查看桶子上方的圖像指示，幫忙將用過的物品分類。垃圾桶在資源回收桶旁邊。小朋友站在桶子旁邊的地板上。大人把托盤放回餐盤回收區的架子上。附近一位店員用濕的清潔抹布擦桌子。桌子的遠端已經乾淨了。掃把、畚箕和拖把放在清潔推車旁邊。一個垃圾袋放在推車旁，與凌亂的桌面保持距離。在出口指示牌附近，其他顧客正離開餐廳。小朋友也很快就準備好離開了。",
